      draw: 'The game does not include a draw mechanic; players use only the four tiles dealt.',
      discard: 'All four tiles must be used in the hand partition; no tiles are discarded.',
      pass: 'Players must actively partition their tiles and cannot pass their turn to act.',
      bid: 'Pai Gow does not involve bidding for contracts or to determine a declarer role.',
      meld: 'The game uses poker-style partition pairs rather than rummy-style sets or runs.',
